American (Traditional), Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":6},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"PDpEFp0lCsXtGsUO1WPllA","review_id":"unI0uOLtK4fD_D6Cq32igg","date":"2015-06-02T20:51:07","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9459044337272644,"text_excerpt":"Wow. This place is pretty cool. When I walked in, I was immediately loving the artwork. It's all original and all amazing. My husband and I dined with friends who had been there months prior and the waitress remembered them in detail. Excellent service. Now for the food.... We started with the fried oyster mushrooms, which were good, but weren't really our cup of tea. Our friends loved them though. We also had the avocado tempura with crabmeat which was pretty amazing. For my entrée, I had the grilled sweetbreads with braised oxtail and pickled root vegetables. It was sooooo delicious. The braised oxtail was sort of sweet which I loved. I can't remember what my husband had, except for his..."},{"business_id":"PDpEFp0lCsXtGsUO1WPllA","review_id":"zcV9-xeaRxslnG_doulcPw","date":"2016-10-30T22:20:46","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9436298608779907,"text_excerpt":"This place is soooo good. I went shortly after it opened, and again last week, and both times I was wildly impressed. Ordered everything off the raw bar menu to share with a friend and each dish they brought out was better than the last. The tuna tartare especially stands out. Also got some shrimp and pork shoulder entree which was yummy, though I recommend sticking to the small plates and sharing a ton of them so you can try more things. Super great decor and ambiance, very cool vibes and perfect for a date."},{"business_id":"PDpEFp0lCsXtGsUO1WPllA","review_id":"uGKR8_tzwtMJlWUdMR0PhQ","date":"2014-08-18T08:18:57","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9395325183868408,"text_excerpt":"Been here twice so far. It's a little pricey but well worth it. The drink list is great and inventive, and the food has all been delicious so far. The inside of the restaurant is stunning-- they've done a great job with the renovations (I felt like I was peeking in for months before they opened!). Excellent date spot. The curry kefir salad would have been good as a smaller side salad, but was a bit overpowering as served. Tomato and burrata appetizer is perfect. Mushroom nori entree was a tiny bit salty, but my mama liked it. Meat-eaters loved their food too."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"PDpEFp0lCsXtGsUO1WPllA","photo_id":"QLB-nc8uzQMN7YweO_rq3w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/QLB-nc8uzQMN7YweO_rq3w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9192754030227661},{"business_id":"PDpEFp0lCsXtGsUO1WPllA","photo_id":"rzRymTr1fs9WkD55-djejA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/rzRymT